{"name":"Apparition","hex":"#c2bca9","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"apparition","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of becoming visible; appearance; visibility.","The thing appearing; a visible object; a form."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/apparition"}],"entries":[{"title":"Apparitional experience","blocks":[{"text":"In parapsychology, an apparitional experience is an anomalous experience characterized by the apparent perception of either a living being or an inanimate object without there being any material stimulus for such a perception."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apparitional_experience","wikidata":"Q4780940"},{"title":"Vision (spirituality)","blocks":[{"text":"A vision is something seen in a dream, trance, or religious ecstasy, especially a supernatural appearance that usually conveys a revelation. Visions generally have more clarity than dreams, but traditionally fewer psychological connotations. Visions are known to emerge from spiritual traditions and could provide a lens into human nature and reality. Prophecy is often associated with visions."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Hildegard_von_Bingen.jpg/330px-Hildegard_von_Bingen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vision_(spirituality)","wikidata":"Q1682108"},{"title":"Apparition (company)","blocks":[{"text":"Apparition was a New York City-based independent film distributor founded by industry veteran Bob Berney and film producer Bill Pohlad. Launched in August 2009, the company specialised in selections from the arthouse and independent film circuits. After releasing six feature films and one short, Apparition suspended its operations in May 2010 when Berney announced his resignation. It closed in late September 2010 after laying off its staff and selling the rights to its last remaining title, The Tree of Life, to Fox Searchlight Pictures."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apparition_(company)","wikidata":"Q3620821"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Sassetta_-_Vision_of_St._Thomas_Aquinas_-_Vatican_Museums.jpg/500px-Sassetta_-_Vision_of_St._Thomas_Aquinas_-_Vatican_Museums.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Sassetta_-_Vision_of_St._Thomas_Aquinas_-_Vatican_Museums.jpg/500px-Sassetta_-_Vision_of_St._Thomas_Aquinas_-_Vatican_Museums.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Vision of Thomas Aquinas in the Vatican Museum ","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASassetta_-_Vision_of_St._Thomas_Aquinas_-_Vatican_Museums.jpg"}],"sounds":{"apparition":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-apparition.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ac/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-apparition.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-apparition.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ac/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-apparition.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-apparition.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Arthur B. Davies, Apparition, 1914, NGA 47797","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Arthur_B._Davies%2C_Apparition%2C_1914%2C_NGA_47797.jpg/500px-Arthur_B._Davies%2C_Apparition%2C_1914%2C_NGA_47797.jpg","ratio":1.380738695201933,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Arthur_B._Davies,_Apparition,_1914,_NGA_47797.jpg","share":0.333125},{"title":"Grey-breasted mountain toucan (Andigena hypoglauca) Caldas","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Grey-breasted_mountain_toucan_%28Andigena_hypogla